# dump-clear
dump stats "$DIR/stats.json"
dump events "$DIR/events.json"
dump logs "$DIR/x"
clearallmessages
clearallmessages now
--- stdout
wrote stats to $DIR/stats.json
wrote events to $DIR/events.json
removed 1 messages; restarted adt
--- stderr
Error: usage: dump stats|events "path"
Error: usage: clearallmessages
--- exit 2
